{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is SEO and why is it important?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "SEO (Search Engine Optimization) improves your website's visibility on search engines to attract organic traffic. VVG ONLINE's SEO Optimization service helps you rank higher on Google and drive qualified leads to your business."}]}
