{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is design thinking?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Design thinking is a human-centered approach to innovation that uses empathy, ideation, and prototyping to solve complex problems. VVG ONLINE offers Innovative Design Thinking Workshops that foster innovation and solve complex business challenges."}]}
