{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How long is a typical design thinking workshop?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "VVG ONLINE offers half-day introductory workshops, full-day deep dives, and multi-day comprehensive programs. Duration depends on your objectives\u2014from awareness building to solving specific complex challenges."}]}
