{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I conduct user research?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Conduct user research through interviews, observations, surveys, usability testing, and journey mapping. VVG ONLINE's User-Centered Design workshops teach practical research methods that your team can apply immediately."}]}
