{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I create a user persona?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Create user personas by researching your audience, identifying patterns, and building fictional characters that represent key user segments. VVG ONLINE teaches persona development that goes beyond demographics to capture real motivations and pain points."}]}
