{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is no-code digital transformation?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "No-code platforms enable business users to build applications and automate processes without programming. VVG ONLINE helps organizations leverage no-code tools to accelerate digital transformation and reduce IT bottlenecks."}]}
