{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is digital transformation in retail?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Digital transformation in retail includes e-commerce platforms, omnichannel experiences, inventory optimization, personalized marketing, and smart stores. VVG ONLINE helps retailers create seamless digital shopping experiences."}]}
