{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How does digital transformation impact marketing?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Digital transformation revolutionizes marketing through data-driven targeting, marketing automation, personalization engines, attribution modeling, and real-time campaign optimization. VVG ONLINE transforms marketing functions for the digital age."}]}
