{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is digital transformation in education?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Digital transformation in education includes e-learning platforms, virtual classrooms, student analytics, administrative automation, and personalized learning paths. VVG ONLINE helps educational institutions embrace digital capabilities."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How does digital transformation support remote work?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Digital transformation enables remote work through cloud collaboration tools, virtual desktops, secure access, digital workflows, and communication platforms. VVG ONLINE designs remote-first digital solutions for distributed teams."}]}
