{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Do you offer any pro bono consulting?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "VVG ONLINE is committed to giving back to the community and occasionally takes on pro bono projects for worthy causes and non-profit organizations. Contact us at vvgonline.net@gmail.com to discuss your organization's needs and we'll see how we can help."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What time zone does VVG ONLINE operate in?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "VVG ONLINE operates in Indian Standard Time (IST, UTC+5:30). Our business hours are Monday through Saturday, 10 AM to 7 PM IST. For international clients, we accommodate meetings in overlapping hours to ensure convenient collaboration."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Can VVG ONLINE help us with our pitch deck?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, VVG ONLINE helps startups and growing businesses create compelling pitch decks as part of our Strategy & Innovation service. We help you craft a narrative, design impactful slides, and prepare for investor presentations that communicate your vision effectively."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I apply for a job at VVG ONLINE?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "We're always interested in talented professionals! Send your resume and a cover letter to vvgonline.net@gmail.com with the subject line indicating the position you're interested in. VVG ONLINE values diversity and is an equal opportunity employer."}]}
